{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-09-03T02:00:00.000Z","text":"今天开学第一天，食堂的糖醋排骨居然要排二十分钟队","ref":"m1"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-09-03T02:04:00.000Z","text":"排骨值得排队，下次早点去","ref":"m2"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-09-03T02:08:00.000Z","text":"你说猫为什么总是把杯子推下桌子？","ref":"m3"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-09-03T02:12:00.000Z","text":"它在做重力实验，每次都要重复验证","ref":"m4"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-09-03T04:00:00.000Z","text":"晚上背疼，可能是搬宿舍的箱子太重了","ref":"m5"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-09-03T04:04:00.000Z","text":"热敷一下，明天别再提重物了","ref":"m6"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-09-03T04:08:00.000Z","text":"好，那我先去洗澡","ref":"m7"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-09-15T06:00:00.000Z","text":"中秋想去看海，你觉得青岛还是厦门？","ref":"m8"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-09-15T06:04:00.000Z","text":"厦门，九月还能下水","ref":"m9"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-09-15T06:08:00.000Z","text":"那就厦门！我去查车票","ref":"m10"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z","text":"国庆第一天，下雨了，海没看成","ref":"m11"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-10-01T08:04:00.000Z","text":"那就在民宿听雨，也算看海的一种","ref":"m12"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-10-01T08:08:00.000Z","text":"番茄炒蛋要先放蛋还是先放番茄？","ref":"m13"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-10-01T08:12:00.000Z","text":"先炒蛋，盛出来再炒番茄","ref":"m14"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-10-02T10:00:00.000Z","text":"天晴了！终于看到海了","ref":"m15"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-10-02T10:04:00.000Z","text":"拍张照片给我看","ref":"m16"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"user","time":"2026-10-02T10:08:00.000Z","text":"月亮为什么不会掉下来呀","ref":"m17"}
{"thread":"daily","label":"日常","role":"assistant","time":"2026-10-02T10:12:00.000Z","text":"因为它一直在往旁边跑，跑得刚好够快","ref":"m18"}
